<Layout title="Our mission" description="StudentOffers brings clear, sourced information about student benefits and opportunities in Armenia into one place."><div class="container"><Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'About' }]} /><header class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Our mission</span><h1>More clarity.<br />More possibility.</h1><p>Student life comes with enough to figure out. Finding the opportunities available to you should be a little easier.</p></header><article class="prose"><h2>A useful starting point.</h2><p>StudentOffers is an independent information platform for students in Armenia. We organize student discounts, banking benefits, mobile plans, transport concessions, and, as research becomes available, careers, education, and other opportunities.</p><p>Our aim is simple: help you understand what an offer includes, who can use it, what it costs, and where to find the official details.</p><h2>The details belong in the open.</h2><p>Every published offer is based on supplied research. We link to available sources, identify general references, and explain when an exact source URL was not supplied. We distinguish research snapshots from independently checked information and preserve eligibility conditions and restrictions.</p><p>We do not promise that every offer is still available or that every student is eligible. Providers make those decisions, and their terms can change.</p><div class="about-links"><a class="button button-dark" href="/about/research/">Research & accuracy <Icon name="right" size={15} /></a><a class="button" href="/about/submit/">Suggest an opportunity <Icon name="arrow" size={15} /></a></div></article></div></Layout>
